```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Q as Event Queue
    participant S as Background Scheduler
    participant DB as Conversation Store
    participant CUR as Processing Cursor
    participant RET as Context Retriever
    participant LLM as Memory Model
    participant VAL as Operation Validator
    participant MM as Memory Manager
    participant TM as Thread Manager
    participant IDX as Search Index

    Q->>S: New conversation observation
    S->>CUR: Read last processed message

    alt Seven meaningful messages accumulated
        S->>DB: Load unprocessed messages
    else Conversation idle for 90 seconds
        S->>DB: Load remaining messages
    else Session ended
        S->>DB: Load remaining messages
    end

    S->>DB: Load previous 10–15 context-only messages
    S->>RET: Retrieve relevant existing memories
    RET-->>S: Related memories and active threads
    S->>CUR: Load previous batch handoff
    CUR-->>S: Entities, topics, summary and unresolved references

    S->>LLM: Messages + overlap + handoff + related memories
    LLM-->>S: Proposed operations and next handoff

    S->>VAL: Validate schema and evidence IDs
    VAL->>DB: Resolve exact source messages

    alt Valid memory operation
        VAL->>MM: Add, reinforce, supersede or retract
        MM->>DB: Persist canonical memory and history
        MM->>IDX: Update embedding
    end

    alt Valid thread operation
        VAL->>TM: Create, continue, pause or complete
        TM->>DB: Persist thread state
    end

    VAL->>CUR: Save new cursor and handoff
```